WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.080
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:15.080
The reading from the Sinaxadion for October 1st, on which we commemorate, the holy protection

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:23.590
of the most holy Thelthokos, the solemnity of the holy protection of our sovereign lady,

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:29.550
the Mother of God, and ever virgin Mary.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.390
The feast of the holy protection of the Mother of God was established following a vision of

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:40.350
our Holy Father Andrew, the fool for Christ, during the course of a vigil in the Church

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.350
of Blacierne at Constantinople.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:51.030
At the fourth hour of the night, while deep in prayer, the saint lifted up his eyes to heaven,

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:58.190
and to be held the holy Mother of God, watching over the congregation as she covered the faithful

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.470
with her veil.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:06.630
Epiphanios, the disciple of Saint Andrew, who was also accounted worthy of looking upon

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:14.150
this wonder, confirmed the truth of the vision, whereupon the saint hastened to the altar,

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:19.710
opened the coffer containing the precious veil of the queen of the world, and standing in front

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:25.070
of the royal doors, extended it above the worshipers.

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:32.670
Upheld by an invisible power, the veil hung in the air, and was of such size, as entirely

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:36.750
to cover the great congregation.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:45.150
Then amid a shattering burst of light, the Mother of God went up into heaven and out of sight,

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:55.030
but leaving the Christian people in possession of her holy veil as a pledge of her loving protection.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:02:00.310
Many a time did the Mother of God give clear evidence of her protection of the imperial

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:09.950
city, and by analogy of the entire holy church of Christ, which is the New Jerusalem.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:16.990
Indeed, everywhere and at every moment, the sovereign lady of the world casts her veil

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:25.910
mystically over Christians as she makes prayer and intercession for the salvation of the world

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.790
to her son and our Lord.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:36.270
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's, O Lord, Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.470
and save us.
